30,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, the person next to the bins is really unhappy! Also, the other block fought over their bin house. We should avoid that.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I've learned that a bin house can actually smell worse in summer. We must be careful not to create a new problem.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Supervision takes about fifty minutes per shift, twenty times a year. Also, permanent structures lead to disputes over maintenance and repairs.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Rin,,It's not fair! One house complained almost every time. And some of our frontages are too narrow for a big bin area.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Money is a delicate matter. A shelter is expensive, and our current open system costs us thirty-four thousand yen annually in small fees.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if the frontages are different, maybe we can't just move the bins anywhere?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, twenty mornings a year sounds like a lot of work for everyone, doesn't it?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"It is a significant time commitment. @Servas, if the current costs are that high, a subsidy might be necessary for any build.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, exactly! We can't just put it anywhere if there's a driveway or it's too skinny.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed. We must consider if the cost of a structure is a burden some cannot bear, despite the subsidy.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"I just want us to be friends. If we fight over who cleans a house, it's bad.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Kenji. A peaceful heart is better than a fancy bin.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Asuka,,Logic suggests that a permanent structure creates long-term maintenance conflicts. We should avoid Option A.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Rin,,But we can't leave it at the same house! That's why the complaints happened.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience, children. We are seeing that both permanent structures and strict supervision have hidden costs in time and spirit.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
